WEBVTT

00:02.120 --> 00:03.883
R-Rumina...

00:04.355 --> 00:06.789
You lay a hand on her
and I'll kill you!

00:07.058 --> 00:09.754
You fool! There's no way
you can fight him alone!

00:10.762 --> 00:12.855
I will be your opponent.

00:13.832 --> 00:20.362
Betraying the Company is going
to cost you, Chelsea Rorec.

00:21.973 --> 00:22.530
Pairon...

00:23.174 --> 00:24.732
It's unfortunate for you.

00:25.276 --> 00:26.971
But I'm taking
the Maiden with me.

00:33.585 --> 00:34.142
Ruri!

00:40.825 --> 00:42.417
R-Rumina!

00:51.669 --> 00:52.693
Damn!

00:52.771 --> 00:55.103
You just wait!
I'll deal with that!

00:55.306 --> 00:56.398
Serpent Whip!

01:00.211 --> 01:03.442
No!

01:06.284 --> 01:10.914
The abandoned subway line
leads into darkness.

01:11.256 --> 01:14.089
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

01:14.626 --> 01:18.528
...beneath Tokyo,
this nation's capital...

01:19.197 --> 01:22.496
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

01:23.268 --> 01:27.329
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

01:50.061 --> 01:53.758
The city at night is so cold

01:53.832 --> 01:57.461
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

01:57.535 --> 02:00.902
I wonder if I can keep going

02:00.972 --> 02:03.497
The important thing...

02:03.575 --> 02:05.042
You must tell me

02:05.777 --> 02:07.608
Please

02:07.712 --> 02:12.411
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

02:12.483 --> 02:17.386
Tell me that's not true

02:18.056 --> 02:21.617
I loved you so much that it hurt

02:21.693 --> 02:25.493
Everything was sparkling all around

02:25.563 --> 02:28.760
There was nothing to be afraid of

02:28.833 --> 02:32.599
I believed in that

02:32.670 --> 02:36.071
That moment when
my passions stirred

02:36.140 --> 02:39.906
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

02:39.978 --> 02:43.141
I will never forget that moment

02:43.214 --> 02:46.843
I will never say I want to go back

02:46.918 --> 02:52.879
I just want to see you one more time

03:06.004 --> 03:06.838
Fight - The Two Water Users

03:06.838 --> 03:10.008
Fight - The Two Water Users
Fight - The Two Water Users.

03:10.008 --> 03:13.409
Fight - The Two Water Users

03:15.313 --> 03:21.047
You should take care of yourself
rather than someone else...

03:21.352 --> 03:22.410
...Rumina.

03:35.967 --> 03:37.730
It's unfortunate.

03:37.802 --> 03:41.568
I wanted to have a little more fun.

03:44.042 --> 03:48.536
This kid sure is unlucky.

03:50.581 --> 03:54.984
If you and your bodyguard hadn't
escaped to his home...

03:55.053 --> 04:01.288
...he would've kept on living
a peaceful surface dweller's life.

04:01.826 --> 04:05.353
Don't you think,
Maiden of Life?

04:15.840 --> 04:18.468
It's nothing to be sad about.

04:18.543 --> 04:22.070
There's always a separation
after there's a meeting.

04:22.146 --> 04:23.807
It's normal.

04:30.922 --> 04:34.289
Don't make a girl cry
in front of me!

04:41.366 --> 04:42.492
How dare you!

04:42.567 --> 04:45.127
How dare you wound me!

04:51.309 --> 04:52.105
Rumina!

04:52.577 --> 04:56.673
Sure, I wasn't too happy
when you first came.

04:57.949 --> 05:01.214
But when you held my hand,
I decided...

05:02.220 --> 05:03.915
...I was going to protect you.

05:05.223 --> 05:07.248
So I don't want you to cry.

05:11.863 --> 05:12.887
Serpent Whip!

05:16.934 --> 05:19.095
I find it hard to understand.

05:19.904 --> 05:22.134
How a surface dweller could...

05:22.206 --> 05:25.198
...go this far
to protect the Maiden?

05:26.044 --> 05:30.310
How would someone like you
understand?!

05:37.889 --> 05:39.857
There's no point in acting tough.

05:40.591 --> 05:43.754
With an injury like that,
you're barely able to stand up.

05:44.228 --> 05:46.628
That goes for you, too!

05:54.839 --> 05:56.807
Give it up, tail head!

06:09.620 --> 06:10.746
No!

06:13.491 --> 06:15.925
And you were so close...

06:18.563 --> 06:21.589
Oh, no...
I'm getting dizzy.

06:27.138 --> 06:29.436
But I can't give up now!

06:32.009 --> 06:32.907
Rumina!

06:33.211 --> 06:34.838
I'll never be able to...

06:36.948 --> 06:40.008
I'll never be able to see Ruri...

06:45.523 --> 06:46.649
How appropriate.

06:46.724 --> 06:48.191
Look at you.

06:48.493 --> 06:50.324
If you keep falling like that...

06:50.394 --> 06:53.830
...you'll never be able to
save the Maiden.

06:53.898 --> 06:54.887
Damn!

06:57.135 --> 06:58.659
Just wait, tail head.

06:58.736 --> 07:00.363
I'm going to...

07:05.943 --> 07:08.878
Please, stop this!

07:09.547 --> 07:10.309
Please.

07:10.381 --> 07:11.712
Stop this!

07:15.319 --> 07:19.016
I just have to go back, right?

07:19.891 --> 07:22.018
I don't want to see this anymore.

07:22.360 --> 07:25.056
I don't want to see
Rumina hurt anymore!

07:25.663 --> 07:26.357
Ruri?!

07:26.430 --> 07:27.454
Why are you...?!

07:28.499 --> 07:30.524
I'm sorry, Rumina.

07:32.336 --> 07:35.203
It was only for a short time...

07:35.273 --> 07:37.400
...but I got to see
the surface world.

07:39.710 --> 07:42.736
The sun's rays were so warm.

07:47.518 --> 07:50.715
Breathing in the air
felt so good.

07:57.295 --> 08:00.321
I even saw
the beautiful moon tonight.

08:02.833 --> 08:03.629
But...

08:03.968 --> 08:06.937
But what made me the happiest...

08:07.505 --> 08:12.169
...was being able to meet kind
people like you and Ginnosuke.

08:13.945 --> 08:14.707
Ruri...

08:16.881 --> 08:19.748
That's why I can't bear
to see you hurt anymore!

08:28.025 --> 08:30.323
You mustn't, Maiden.

08:33.998 --> 08:35.898
Rumina! Rumina!

08:35.967 --> 08:37.093
Rumina!

08:37.635 --> 08:38.533
Why?!

08:39.503 --> 08:45.840
I can't leave him alone
after he wounded me.

08:49.947 --> 08:51.209
Water Thread.

08:51.515 --> 08:53.039
I will use a thread of water...

08:53.117 --> 08:56.644
...under very high pressure
to slowly torture you...

08:56.721 --> 08:58.279
...as I cut you apart!

09:02.126 --> 09:02.922
No!

09:03.327 --> 09:04.658
Please stop!

09:07.131 --> 09:09.691
At this rate, Rumina will...

09:10.568 --> 09:12.035
You know I can't...

09:12.103 --> 09:15.072
...no matter how many times
you ask.

09:15.740 --> 09:16.604
Please!

09:16.674 --> 09:17.606
Please!

09:20.878 --> 09:21.742
I...

09:21.812 --> 09:23.336
I never...

09:25.850 --> 09:29.411
I never want to see
Rumina die again!

09:45.002 --> 09:47.630
What? This wind...

09:52.810 --> 09:53.708
You...

09:53.778 --> 09:56.110
How many times
do I have to tell you?

09:56.180 --> 09:59.616
Don't make a girl...

10:00.618 --> 10:03.985
Don't make girls
cry in front of me!

10:10.227 --> 10:13.458
So you still have
that much strength left.

10:13.964 --> 10:18.628
You've used up all your power.
You're at your limit.

10:18.703 --> 10:20.000
What more can you do?

10:26.610 --> 10:27.406
Wind?

10:28.045 --> 10:28.909
This is...

10:32.249 --> 10:33.341
...a tornado!

10:36.320 --> 10:38.948
I'll blow you away, tail head!

10:53.838 --> 10:54.736
What was that?

10:56.073 --> 10:57.062
Ruri?

10:58.476 --> 11:01.343
Did Teil screw up or something?

11:02.279 --> 11:04.304
This time you get off.

11:04.982 --> 11:08.008
You get away with your life,
Chelsea Rorec.

11:12.556 --> 11:13.682
Hold it!

11:15.259 --> 11:17.124
Ruri!

11:19.463 --> 11:20.293
Rumina...

11:47.725 --> 11:48.783
Rumina!

11:48.859 --> 11:49.848
Rumina!

11:51.562 --> 11:54.360
Rumina!

12:00.538 --> 12:01.835
Who are you?

12:01.906 --> 12:03.498
I'm Pairon.

12:03.841 --> 12:07.800
I suppose you would call me
a Company agent.

12:13.984 --> 12:17.442
Pairon! He's my prize!

12:18.522 --> 12:19.352
Teil...

12:19.790 --> 12:22.918
Looks like he played with you
quite a bit.

12:25.796 --> 12:28.731
Thanks to you, people here
have taken notice.

12:29.600 --> 12:31.727
You do know that
the ultimate objective...

12:31.802 --> 12:34.828
...is to bring the Maiden
back to the Company.

12:35.339 --> 12:37.136
You do remember that, don't you?

12:37.808 --> 12:39.173
Y-Yes, but...

12:39.510 --> 12:40.442
Fine.

12:41.679 --> 12:42.941
H-Hold it!

12:43.380 --> 12:44.005
I'm not finished!

12:44.081 --> 12:44.843
Stop it!

12:46.884 --> 12:49.614
As long as you're alive,
we'll meet again.

12:49.687 --> 12:50.210
So...

12:53.457 --> 12:54.446
So, please...

12:55.759 --> 12:57.090
Please.

13:01.065 --> 13:02.123
Very wise.

13:02.199 --> 13:03.063
Thank you.

13:20.784 --> 13:21.751
Come on...

13:28.726 --> 13:29.556
Rumina!

13:58.889 --> 14:00.789
It's a full moon tonight.

14:02.626 --> 14:06.653
The moon always appears
as though it's following us.

14:06.964 --> 14:08.864
Of course, it's just an illusion.

14:18.409 --> 14:20.309
Let go!

14:21.278 --> 14:22.245
Easy.

14:22.479 --> 14:23.741
I can't get the bandage on.

14:23.814 --> 14:26.647
I've got to go and rescue Ruri!

14:26.817 --> 14:27.476
Rumina.

14:27.551 --> 14:28.916
It was because...

14:28.986 --> 14:31.284
It was because I didn't
have enough strength.

14:33.057 --> 14:34.490
Hey, Rumina!

14:34.692 --> 14:37.559
Just stay still for a bit.
I can't get the bandage on.

14:37.628 --> 14:39.255
If only I was stronger!

14:46.470 --> 14:47.494
S-Sorry...

14:47.638 --> 14:49.128
No need to apologize.

14:50.074 --> 14:53.908
The best thing to do to someone
who's losing it is to hit him.

14:56.614 --> 14:57.808
Blondie...

15:03.020 --> 15:05.682
Please tell us more
about the Underground.

15:09.760 --> 15:13.355
What's the point of knowing
at this stage?

15:13.430 --> 15:14.294
What?

15:14.365 --> 15:18.461
Weren't you just saying that
you wish you were stronger?

15:19.737 --> 15:22.103
Ruri is the Maiden of Life...

15:22.172 --> 15:23.935
...so you can be assured of her life.

15:24.408 --> 15:27.468
Then all we have to do
is go and rescue her.

15:31.081 --> 15:33.276
So, please.
Tell us, Chelsea.

15:33.350 --> 15:35.910
Tell us what the Underground is.

15:35.986 --> 15:39.786
And why the Company
agents are coming after you.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.191
You really want to know?

15:45.262 --> 15:46.251
Of course.

15:46.463 --> 15:48.590
Well, there's nothing to hide really.

15:48.666 --> 15:50.531
I suppose I can tell you...

15:50.601 --> 15:53.195
...why the Underground
was created in the first place.

16:29.873 --> 16:33.206
Deep beneath the city of Tokyo,
this nation's capital...

16:33.277 --> 16:36.178
...scientists were researching
certain powers.

16:36.880 --> 16:40.816
These powers were harnessed by...

16:40.884 --> 16:43.614
...and resembled
the basic elements of nature...

16:43.687 --> 16:46.520
...like Seki's "Flame"
or Teil's "Water."

16:48.025 --> 16:51.051
My power of "Gravity" and
Ruri's power are also like that.

17:01.205 --> 17:04.641
But the scientists felt that
was not enough.

17:05.109 --> 17:09.842
Intense research eventually
yielded something truly horrific.

17:10.214 --> 17:11.909
Horrific?

17:15.652 --> 17:16.414
Ron.

17:17.087 --> 17:17.883
Ron?

17:18.255 --> 17:19.381
Like, dragons?

17:23.861 --> 17:26.728
Even the scientists who created
them couldn't control them...

17:26.797 --> 17:30.665
...and they were sealed away
deep in the Underground.

17:30.968 --> 17:34.233
As the name implies,
these are dragon-like monsters...

17:34.304 --> 17:36.363
...sometimes referred to as
giant beasts.

17:40.377 --> 17:44.279
Fearing the power
of the Dragons...

17:44.348 --> 17:48.148
...the scientists killed them and sealed
off the Underground for good.

17:49.953 --> 17:52.080
Since then,
people of the Underground...

17:52.156 --> 17:54.249
...have been trapped below...

17:54.324 --> 17:57.350
...and forced to live
underground.

18:12.509 --> 18:13.737
Hey, Blondie!

18:13.811 --> 18:17.577
I didn't ask about
some monster Dragons!

18:17.648 --> 18:20.515
I want to know about the Company
and why they took Ruri!

18:21.118 --> 18:23.712
It's the organization
that rules the Underground.

18:24.488 --> 18:25.716
I told you that before.

18:25.789 --> 18:29.350
What does Ruri
have to do with the monsters?

18:34.464 --> 18:39.367
There are people who want to use
the power of the dormant Dragons.

18:39.837 --> 18:40.826
Don't you get it?

18:41.271 --> 18:43.535
People who want to use
the power of the Dragons?

18:45.609 --> 18:50.444
They want to resurrect the Dragons
to claim revenge...

18:50.514 --> 18:53.347
...against the surface people
who abandoned them.

18:53.650 --> 18:55.880
By using Ruri's power.

18:56.286 --> 18:59.050
The power of resurrection?

19:00.891 --> 19:04.622
When you fought against
the flame user that first time...

19:04.695 --> 19:06.720
...you actually died.

19:08.799 --> 19:11.290
With Ruri's
power of resurrection...

19:11.368 --> 19:13.063
...you regained your life.

19:32.856 --> 19:34.118
I see...

19:34.825 --> 19:38.192
That's Ruri's power of resurrection.

19:42.466 --> 19:46.197
Out of all the power users...
No, out of anyone in the world...

19:46.270 --> 19:49.262
...she is the only one
that can restore life.

19:50.007 --> 19:52.032
Ruri is the only one.

19:54.678 --> 19:58.079
So, the Company wants to
use the Maiden of Life's power...

19:58.148 --> 20:00.082
...to bring back the Dragons.

20:06.390 --> 20:09.291
They're trying to use
innocent Ruri...

20:09.359 --> 20:12.817
...to help them carry out a plan that
will result in many deaths.

20:23.573 --> 20:26.508
Now, come with me.

20:28.779 --> 20:29.803
Maiden.

20:39.356 --> 20:44.191
Again, I walk the streets today

20:44.261 --> 20:49.995
As if I have a purpose

20:50.067 --> 21:01.968
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:03.347 --> 21:13.882
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:13.957 --> 21:25.994
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:26.536 --> 21:35.444
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:35.512 --> 21:39.278
I tried to listen

21:39.349 --> 21:47.279
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:47.357 --> 21:57.198
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:05.742 --> 22:07.539
Preview

22:07.611 --> 22:09.078
I wasn't able to protect her.

22:09.146 --> 22:11.011
If only I was stronger...

22:11.081 --> 22:14.107
...then I would've been able to
save Ruri from her misery.

22:14.684 --> 22:15.548
Wait!

22:15.652 --> 22:19.383
If I could somehow learn
the sword techniques of Gramps!

22:19.456 --> 22:21.117
I can't mess around anymore!

22:21.758 --> 22:24.591
I have to do everything I can
to get stronger!

22:25.395 --> 22:27.863
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:28.165 --> 22:28.532
..."Training and Resolve."

22:28.532 --> 22:30.734
Training and Resolve
..."Training and Resolve."

22:30.734 --> 22:35.535
Training and Resolve
